{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494130/extras/Plot_ENG.jpg?t=1746713612\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;The clinking of chains...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They said you were sick. Prescribed pills. Begged you to stay in touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But you chose solitude \u2014 just you, your cat, and the old house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;The clinking of chains...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up, as always, to feed your cat. But something is off: one of the doors is locked, and the key is nowhere to be found. A metallic ringing echoes in your head. In the bathroom, something rotten flickers into sight\u2014then vanishes. And on the mirror... a note from your childhood doll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Memories stir. Your grandmother\u2019s curse \u2014 forgotten, but never gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;The clinking of chains...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why did she do this to you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;The clinking of chains...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore the house, you piece the doll back together \u2014 and suddenly, a hidden passage appears in the garage. It leads to a world from your dreams. Or your past. Or your madness. Endless stairways, coffins in the walls, worm-infested tunnels. They call to you \u2014 and terrify you all the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;The clinking of chains...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What is that damned sound echoing in your mind?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494130/extras/Gameplay_ENG.jpg?t=1746713612\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. A classic walking simulator with a psychological horror twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Explore your home and uncover hidden objects to unlock the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Solve light puzzles</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494130/extras/Gamefeautures_ENG.jpg?t=1746713612\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. The game has autosave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Realistic graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. High-quality sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Average game completion time: 30-60 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5. Genre: Walking Simulator.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494130/extras/Attention_ENG.jpg?t=1746713612\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Note! The game features machine translation into the following languages:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- French</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- German</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Spanish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Portuguese (Brazilian)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Chinese (Simplified)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Korean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Polish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Japanese</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3494130?t=1746713612","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494130/d44dd58756be3a824f2122a2927aa2a84b6210b3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746713612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494130/282ec8385ede09ae2b054046bc66f4fdd5acd391/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746713612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494130/282ec8385ede